'''Miria''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Miria's Hut}} within the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}} that hosts the island's [[Starlyn Contest]]s.

== Contests ==
{{Main|Starlyn Contest}}
'''Miria''' hosts a contest that takes place every SkyBlock Day and lasts for {{Green|20}} real-life minutes. During the contest, a player can gain points through various means.

== Shop ==
'''Miria's''' Shop has {{Green|5}} milestones, which are progressed by collecting {{Item|Miria's Coupon}}s. Each contest awards a certain amount of {{Item|Miria's Coupon}}s based on rarity.

