== Notes ==
*'''Miria''' will only keep your rewards from previous contests for one Skyblock year.
== Trivia ==
*It requires {{Item|Miria's Coupon|amount=8506}}, {{Item|Miria's Prize|amount=37}}, {{Item|Enchanted Helix Log|amount=2148}} and {{Item|Helixis|amount=286}} to max out the Miria's Shop. It includes {{Yellow|+2 {{Skill|Foraging}} Level Cap}}, Miria's Power, Miria's Personal Best and [[Helix Log|Helix]] Fortune perks, {{Item|Woodpecker Shard|amount=64}} and {{Item|Vulture Shard|amount=48}}, obtaining {{Item|Sloth Pet|rarity=l}}, {{Item|Torrhus Artifact}}, {{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Petalfall V}} and {{Item|Vial of Spring Water|amount=2}}.
**This comes out to a total of {{BZC|8506 MIRIA_COUPON|37 MIRIA_PRIZE|2148 Enchanted Helix Log|286 Helixis}} if a player wishes to max out everything there.

